WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.467
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:05.400
A lot of stories come across
my desk that I have absolutely

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.501
no interest in addressing --

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:10.634
meaningless headlines in a sea
of important news.

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:13.601
But one of my writers thinks
that shouldn't stop you from

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:16.234
having to listen to them,
and I guess sometimes,

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.968
we just need a distraction,
so here's a new segment

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:23.100
called "Stories Only
Dina Deems Important."

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.968
♪♪

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.400
-Seth, I'm going to get right
into it.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.100
No time for pleasantries.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.467
I was scrolling through
my curated newsfeed

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:35.868
and came across this article.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:39.767
"Cockroach sex has taken
a strange turn."

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:42.501
Now, you may have bristled
at that headline

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:45.133
or just read something else,
but get this.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:48.634
When a male cockroach wants to
mate with a female cockroach,

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:52.734
he will scoot his butt
toward her, open his wings,

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:55.033
and offer her a homemade meal.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:56.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:58.167
The meal he makes for her
is made of

00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:02.400
the two best ingredients --
a mix of sugars and fats.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.634
And as the female cockroach
nibbles her meal,

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:09.100
the male locks on to her
with one penis

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:13.534
while another penis
delivers a sperm package.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.801
Seth?

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.100
-What? No!

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.434
Don't "Seth" me. I don't want
to be a part of this.

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:24.901
I didn't want to be a part of it
before, and now that I know

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:27.400
what it's about, definitely no.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.400
-Fine, let's just recap here.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.934
Before the male cockroach
even approaches the woman,

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.934
he makes her dinner.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.367
He cooks for her.

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:43.000
Then the male roach offers up,
not one, but two penises.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:47.634
And if everything goes smoothly,
guess how long he can go?

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:48.701
-I couldn't tell you.

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:51.133
It has never even crossed
my mind.

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:52.968
-Around 90 minutes.

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:54.400
[ Audience ohs ]

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:58.634
Yeah. You know what lasts 90
minutes in bed with a human man?

00:01:58.634 --> 00:01:59.634
-I don't.

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:00.934
-Neither do I!

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:02.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:07.701
Seth, look at this video.

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:11.334
Look how tenderly and sweetly
the male cockroach

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:12.701
treats the woman.

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:15.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:23.534
This is my favorite part.

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:24.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:26.701
True intimacy.

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.400
-Dina, we get it.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:32.434
But, like, what's the problem
or, like, the point here?

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:35.534
-Well, because of the pesticides
we humans use,

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.801
many female cockroaches
have lost their taste

00:02:37.801 --> 00:02:39.767
for the sweet stuff
the males make,

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:42.200
and that could change
how they mate and multiply.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.901
-Yeah, but wouldn't that be
a good thing for us?

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:45.033
Less roaches?

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.734
-You're missing the point, Seth.

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:50.000
If the female cockroach doesn't
pick up what the male cockroach

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.634
puts down,
she's not sticking around.

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:54.467
She's out.

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:57.767
No couples therapy,
no writing sappy letters

00:02:57.767 --> 00:02:59.601
or texts to each other.

00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:02.334
No one hovering,
checking in from time to time

00:03:02.334 --> 00:03:04.834
with an obscure picture
of that trip you both took

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:07.467
to the Berkshires and got so
buzzed you forgot

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:09.100
where you parked the car.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.033
She doesn't have time for that.

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:15.567
If the female cockroach isn't
getting exactly what she wants,

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:17.267
she is done.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:18.400
For good.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.734
Seth?

00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:24.968
-Was that a question
or a cry for help?

00:03:24.968 --> 00:03:27.567
Dina, what are you trying
to tell --

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.968
-Ladies!

00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:32.234
Ladies, ladies, ladies.

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:35.234
We have to be more like
these female cockroaches.

00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:37.267
If he's not giving you exactly
what you want,

00:03:37.267 --> 00:03:39.033
you need to let him go.

00:03:39.033 --> 00:03:40.267
Maybe --

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:45.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.133 --> 00:03:47.767
Look, maybe if we were treated
like female cockroaches

00:03:47.767 --> 00:03:51.167
and got what we deserved,
we'd live forever, too.

00:03:51.167 --> 00:03:53.634
So next time you see a roach
in your studio apartment

00:03:53.634 --> 00:03:56.234
above Penn Station,
don't scream.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:58.067
Just take a moment to think,

00:03:58.067 --> 00:04:01.434
"Maybe we can learn to be more
like them."

00:04:01.434 --> 00:04:04.567
Knowing your worth means getting
what you want.

00:04:04.567 --> 00:04:06.267
No bull [bleep].

00:04:06.267 --> 00:04:09.133
Just like the female cockroach.

00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:10.200
Now, Seth?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:17.334 --> 00:04:19.634
Now back to you, Seth --
for real this time.

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:22.968
-All right, well, Dina --
wait, did you say this story

00:04:22.968 --> 00:04:25.501
came across
your curated newsfeed?

00:04:25.501 --> 00:04:29.067
-I'm Dina, and yes, these are
the stories I deem important!

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:31.567
Tune in next week when
I break down why vegan shellfish

00:04:31.567 --> 00:04:34.200
live a long, fulfilling life.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.934
♪♪

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:37.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

